    "description": "### Impact\r\n\r\nUsers archives are viewable by users with moderation privileges even though moderators should not have access to the archives. Private topic/post content made by the users are leaked through the archives leading to a breach of confidentiality. \r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\n\r\nTo workaround this problem, a site admin can temporarily revoke the moderation role from all moderators until the Discourse instance has been upgraded to a version that has been patched. ",
